{"name":"Little Bow Pink","hex":"#d37c99","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"little","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Small, not large, limited, particularly:","Small, limited in size."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Not much.","Not at all."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/little"},{"term":"bow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Rema."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A weapon made of a curved piece of wood or other flexible material whose ends are connected by a string, used for shooting arrows.","A curved bend in a rod or planar surface, or in a linear formation such as a river (see oxbow)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bow"},{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Little Bow","blocks":[{"text":"Little Bow was a provincial electoral district in Alberta, Canada, mandated to return a single member to the Legislative Assembly of Alberta from 1913 to 2019. Throughout its history, this district has been dominated by agricultural activities. Because the area is prone to summer time drought and frequent water rationing, agriculture has been limited to grain crops and cattle ranches. The 2003 BSE crisis, and the subsequent closure of the US border to Canadian cattle, became a major election issue."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/LittleBow_in_Alberta.jpg/330px-LittleBow_in_Alberta.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Bow","wikidata":"Q6649233"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink","wikidata":"Q429220"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/Whereislittlebow.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/Whereislittlebow.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWhereislittlebow.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/LittleBow_electoral_district_2010.jpg/500px-LittleBow_electoral_district_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/LittleBow_electoral_district_2010.jpg/500px-LittleBow_electoral_district_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALittleBow_electoral_district_2010.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg/500px-LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg/1280px-LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg/500px-LittleBow_in_Calgary.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_con